title: Module1Menu_FirstTime
---
<<activate_checklist Checklist>>

Virtual Instructor: Welcome to the Ergonomic Risk Lab. Here, you'll observe real construction tasks and evaluate their risks using ergonomic tools. Let's begin.

<<toggle_reba_demo Module1MenuBootstrapper true>>
Virtual Instructor: To evaluate tasks, you'll use a tool called REBA - Rapid Entire Body Assessment. It helps identify which postures and movements are risky. You'll answer simple questions about the worker's body positions - like how much they bend, reach, or lift. The system will calculate a risk score from 1 (safe) to 15 (very risky). The higher the score, the more urgent it is to fix the posture or bring in support like an exoskeleton.

Virtual Instructor: Watch how the tool breaks down posture. You'll see what body parts are involved, what movements cause strain, and how your answers shape the risk level.

<<toggle_reba_demo Module1MenuBootstrapper false>>
<<activate_menu Module1MenuBootstrapper>>
Virtual Instructor: Each of the items in this menu represent a trade. Please select one to proceed. We'll meet again at the site you choose!

<<hide_vi Module1MenuBootstrapper>>
Virtual Instructor: Good luck!
===

title: Module1Menu_Repeat
---
<<activate_checklist Checklist>>

Virtual Instructor: Please, select a trade station to proceed.
===

title: Module1Menu_WRL
---
<<activate_checklist Checklist>>

Virtual Instructor: Welcome to the Wearable Robotics Lab! You've identified which tasks put the body at risk. Now, let's see how wearable robots can help protect workers.

Virtual Instructor: You'll explore different types of exoskeletons, understand what they do, and try them out on real tasks.

<<activate_wrl Module1MenuBootstrapper>>
Virtual Instructor: Click on each exoskeleton to learn how it works. Then, pick one you think could improve a task you scored earlier.

<<activate_menu Module1MenuBootstrapper>>
Virtual Instructor: You may take that exoskeleton to one of the activities you chose earlier. That activity will look different if you bring an exoskeleton with you!
===

